      <author><name>Kieron Gillen</name></author>
    

    
      <published>2025-11-12</published>
    

    
      <summary type="text">DIE returns for an epic new story of a dark fantasy adventure game gone horrifically right or wonderfully wrong. A year after their return from the hellish game world, the players gather for Chuck’s wake. They’ve finished with the game. The game isn’t finished with them. The three-time Hugo Award-nominated series is back in November. Get ready to roll initiative. Who’s going to DIE this time?</summary>
    

    
  
